# Test My Mettle (otherAreas 25): Davoi's Jar. Available: no section: the Jar's default (NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY).
# Accepted (a GM), a full inventory: npcUtil.giveItem fails (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED), the jar stays, noAction (no
# default). Room made: the sandals given, the jar moved, noAction; the sandals held: nil: the default.
# moveJar (helpers.lua, ported for this trigger): randomInt(125, 10800) for Davoi_Jar_Move_Time = now + it (a server
# variable: the trace does not show it); npcUtil.pickNewPosition: math.randomInt(1, 0) (1, no draw), the jar's current
# spot found by its floored coordinates (its first spot, -95.6,2.5,-50.8, is none of the ten: index 1), then
# randomInt(1, 10) until it differs; npcUtil.queueMove: setPos(x, y, z, 0) 3000 ms later (the tick after each move).
# Five more moves, each from the spot the last one chose: the sandals traded to Devean in Selbina with the timer over
# (123; its finish takes them and drops the quest), accepted again (a GM), back in Davoi, the Jar.
# Davoi's own onGameHour moves the jar too once GetSystemTime() reaches Davoi_Jar_Move_Time: the snapshot's
# 1800004534 is never reached (the clock stays at 1800000000: no `wait jst`).
lists Davoi/Jar/onTrigger Selbina/Devean/onTrade Selbina/onEventFinish/123
char zone=Davoi pos=-94.1,2.5,-50.8 job=WAR lvl=10 nation=1
login
trigger Jar                             # available: no section: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
fill-inventory
trigger Jar                             # giveItem fails (ITEM_CANNOT_BE_OBTAINED); the jar stays; noAction
free-inventory
trigger Jar                             # the sandals given; the jar moved; noAction
tick 4000                               # move 1 lands
trigger Jar                             # the sandals held: nil: NOTHING_OUT_OF_ORDINARY
warp 41.4,-14.6,40 Selbina
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # the timer over (Timer 0): 123
finish                                  # the sandals taken; off the current list
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
warp -94.1,2.5,-50.8 Davoi
trigger Jar                             # the sandals given; move 2 (from move 1's spot)
tick 4000
warp 41.4,-14.6,40 Selbina
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # 123
finish
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
warp -94.1,2.5,-50.8 Davoi
trigger Jar                             # move 3
tick 4000
warp 41.4,-14.6,40 Selbina
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # 123
finish
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
warp -94.1,2.5,-50.8 Davoi
trigger Jar                             # move 4
tick 4000
warp 41.4,-14.6,40 Selbina
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # 123
finish
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
warp -94.1,2.5,-50.8 Davoi
trigger Jar                             # move 5
tick 4000
warp 41.4,-14.6,40 Selbina
trade Devean PowerSandals x1            # 123
finish
quest OtherAreas.TestMyMettle accepted  # a GM
warp -94.1,2.5,-50.8 Davoi
trigger Jar                             # move 6
tick 4000
trigger Jar                             # the sandals held: nil
